# Without echo-message, a sent message is printed at once. Text for the
# console, a parted channel or an offline network is refused with a notice.
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
! say #c hi all
> PRIVMSG #c :hi all
? line #c <textual> hi all
? unread #c 0 highlights 0
! say console hello
? line console Messages cannot be sent to this window.
? notice Messages cannot be sent to this window.
< :textual!u@h PART #c
! say #c anyone?
? line #c You are not in this channel.
! disconnect
> QUIT
< ERROR :Closing Link
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: quit
< :bob!b@h PRIVMSG textual :late
! say #c x
? line #c Not connected.
? offline user-quit
